   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p><img src=\"exercises/media/d81dcd1bc0588e2b.jpg\" alt=\"A flow chart shows the stimulus a cat experience and the resulting behavior. Footsteps resulted in greeting behavior. Loud noise resulted in hiding behavior. Many trials of footsteps followed by loud noise resulted in hiding behavior.\"></p>\n\n<p>This representation was created to describe how the behavior of a cat was affected as it was exposed to different stimuli. \nIdentify the term that should be used for the process represented by this diagram.</p>\n",
